<title>USA: Schwab reports August fund inflow.</title>
<headline>Schwab reports August fund inflow.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Charles Schwab Corp said on Tuesday its domestic growth mutual funds posted inflows of $725.2 million in August, versus outflows of $754.1 million in July.</p>
<p>International growth funds recorded August inflows of $254.1 million, versus outflows of $110.3 million in July.</p>
<p>Balanced funds posted inflows of $128 miullion versus outflows of $175.6 million.</p>
<p>Taxable bond funds showed inflows rose to $210.6 million from $84.2 million in July , and tax-free funds inflows rose to $60.9 million from $29.3.</p>
</text>
